* Module 2: MS-20 style Resonant Sallen-Key LPF (VCF)
* LM13700 OTA + TL072, diode-limited feedback

VCC VCC 0 DC 12
VEE VEE 0 DC -12

* Input signal
VIN IN 0 SIN(0 1 1000)

* Cutoff CV (0-5V from envelope) attenuated
VCV CV 0 DC 2.5

* OTA transconductance: gm = Iabc/(2VT); model as VCCS controlled by CV
* Use G device: I = gm*Vdiff, gm = 1mS per volt CV approx
Gota1 X1 0 CV 0 1m
* Sallen-Key: input resistor
R1 IN N1 10k
* OTA acts as resistor from N1 to ground? Simplify: use OTA output as current into node
* Feedback capacitor
C1 N1 0 10n
R2 N1 N2 10k
C2 N2 0 10n
* Buffer
Ebuf OUT 0 N2 0 1

* Resonance feedback: output -> diode pair -> input node
D1 OUT X1 1N4148
RX1 X1 NR 100
D2 NR X2 1N4148
RX2 X2 OUT 100
Rres NR N1 47k

* Decoupling
Cdec1 VCC 0 100n
Cdec2 VEE 0 100n

.model 1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=10 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=0.4 tt=20n)

.control
.options reltol=1e-3 abstol=1e-9 vntol=1e-6 method=gear
tran 10u 50m uic
wrdata /tmp/vcf_ms20.cir.csv time OUT
print v(OUT)
.endc
.end